5,1,1,talk,Rin,,We need a plan that doesn't waste our time! I want to see the morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs and the unplanned seat shuffles in the past year.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I'm interested in the costs. I'll look into the basis of the department's floor billing and the facilities quote for re-running power and network.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We should be fair about the layout. I'll check the drawn plan against the staff survey and the arrival times in the badge records.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,Comfort is key. I'll take the sound meter readings across the room and the physio's note from the workstation check.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I want us to stay connected. I'll look at the two project strands within earshot last spring and what this year's two joiners reported.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
