50,3,1,talk,Rin,,"The options are Free Address, Rotating Blocks, or Fixed Desks by Function. I'm voting for Fixed.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Free Address is a waste of time, and Rotating is a waste of money. Fixed Desks by Function is the only viable path.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,Free Address is unfair to late arrivals. Fixed Desks by Function allows us to distribute the window seats properly.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Shion,,Rotating is a nightmare for ergonomics. Fixed Desks by Function is the only way to maintain a proper setup.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Yumi,,Fixed Desks by Function ensures the right people are within earshot. I support it.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
